Package: org.Nv.eg.db
Title: Genome Wide Annotation for Notophthalmus viridescens
Description: Gene-level annotation of the eastern newt (Notophthalmus viridescens)
    de novo transcriptome of Tsissios et al. (2024; GEO GSE236907), which is used as
    published, not reassembled. A gene is a cluster of transcripts
    that overlap at >= 98 % identity, with non-overlapping fragments of one gene joined
    through their alignments to the same Swiss-Prot protein, and the myogenic regulatory
    factors Myf5, Myog and Myf6 added from the transcriptome of Abdullayev et al. (2013).
    The cluster IDs (GID) map to SYMBOL, GENENAME, UNIPROT, GO and GOALL, and TXID (the
    transcripts) through the AnnotationDbi select() interface, so it works with clusterProfiler like
    any other OrgDb.
Version: 1.0.0
